# Report Export System

## Export endpoints

- `GET /api/report-builder/:id/export/pdf` — pdfkit
- `GET /api/report-builder/:id/export/docx` — docx library
- `GET /api/report-builder/:id/export/pptx` — v1 (legacy) or v2 (pipeline)
  - `?version=2` → BCG-grade component pipeline (`PptxPipelineService`)
  - default → legacy monolithic `PptxExportService`

## PPTX v2 pipeline flow

```
Route → load report + block types → PptxPipelineService.generateFromLegacyReport()
  → UnifiedJsonTransformer (sections → slides with intents)
  → RulesEngine.validateReport() (quality gates)
  → per slide: resolveLayout(intent) → LayoutFn → composites → atomics → pptxgenjs
  → pptx.write() → Buffer → file → download
```

## Never break v1

- `PptxExportService.ts` (v1) must remain unchanged
- v2 is opt-in via `?version=2` query param
- Both write to `exports/report-builder/` and create export records
